\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Sort discipline on a single sphere. Mix on $(\mathtt  {num},\mathtt  {num})$ is the clock trap of Section~\ref {subsec:clock_encoding}: it is geometrically defined and type-refused. Mix on $(\mathtt  {word},\mathtt  {word})$ is allowed as geometry and carries no linguistic $\chi $-claim (Axiom~\ref {subsec:axiom0_admissibility}, Tier~0). Mix as a domain reading is the color inclusion of Axiom~\ref {subsec:axiom_interference}. $^{*}$Numeric $T$ and numeric offset may be defined later as maps of the chosen numeric encoding; they are not the lexical operators of Sections~\ref {sec:transformation_algebra} and~\ref {sec:analogical_offset}.}}{14}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
